WEBVTT

00:00:16.093 --> 00:00:19.180
Martha, what have I done?
玛莎,我做了什么?

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.355
-Where is my bill?
-Over here. I'm next.
我的账单在哪里?

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.483
-I'm checking out.
-Take my key! Take my key!
那不是我的账单!

00:00:31.776 --> 00:00:32.943
What is this minibar charge?
这是什么迷你吧收费?

00:00:32.985 --> 00:00:35.154
Honey, the kids threw
the minibar out the window.
亲爱的,孩子们把迷你吧丢出窗口

00:00:35.196 --> 00:00:37.323
-And that's our fault?
-Well...
-那是我们的错? -嗯..

00:00:37.448 --> 00:00:39.992
Excuse me! Pardon, yeah.
对不起.不好意思

00:00:40.034 --> 00:00:43.454
Excuse me, I got a couple
of people to express mail.
对不起,我有几个人要快邮!

00:00:44.997 --> 00:00:46.749
Friends, please, stop.
朋友,请停止

00:00:46.832 --> 00:00:48.959
It's too late, rat-bat!
太迟了,骗子

00:00:49.001 --> 00:00:50.503
Please, I'm begging you.
拜托,我求你们

00:00:50.544 --> 00:00:53.339
I need you to help me find Johnny.
我要你们帮我找约翰尼

00:00:53.381 --> 00:00:55.466
The human? He could've killed us!
那人类?他会杀了我们!

00:00:55.508 --> 00:00:57.343
He touched my guitar!
他碰过我的吉他!

00:00:57.385 --> 00:01:01.597
He put his hand in my mouth
to see if it would disappear.
他把手放进我的口看是否会消失

00:01:01.847 --> 00:01:05.059
He let me eat his scooter!
他让我吃他的踏板车!

00:01:06.519 --> 00:01:08.854
I know I lied.
我知道我说谎

00:01:08.979 --> 00:01:10.523
I was wrong.
我错了

00:01:10.648 --> 00:01:12.400
But you have to believe this:
但是你们必须相信

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:16.112
Johnny wasn't a bad guy.
约翰尼不是坏人

00:01:17.321 --> 00:01:21.534
The truth is, I don't even know
if humans are bad anymore.
其实我根本不知道人类是否还是坏人

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:27.957
Frank, come on, buddy. You understand.
弗兰克,拜托.你明白的

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.542
He's not talking to you.
他不和你说话

00:01:29.583 --> 00:01:32.002
First you tell us humans are bad,
now they're good.
你先说人类很坏现在是好人.还有呢?

00:01:32.044 --> 00:01:34.880
What else?
Up is down, cold is hot, gremlins don't smell.
上是下,冷是热,精灵不臭

00:01:35.172 --> 00:01:37.007
Hey!
嘿!

00:01:38.551 --> 00:01:42.596
I really liked Johnny, cousin or no.
He told fun stories.
我真的喜欢约翰尼,表弟与否

00:01:42.888 --> 00:01:44.890
I think they Zinged.
我想他们一见钟情

00:01:45.015 --> 00:01:46.267
They Zinged?
他们一见钟情

00:01:46.392 --> 00:01:48.394
But I got in the way.
但是我阻止了他们

00:01:49.228 --> 00:01:52.064
You only Zing once in your life.
人生只有一次一见钟情

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:56.068
-Oy, now you're short-circuiting.
-I don't care!
你疯了

00:01:56.652 --> 00:01:58.904
Well, what are we doing? Let's get Johnny.
Come on!
我们在干吗?快找约翰尼!快!

00:01:58.946 --> 00:02:01.198
-Yeah, let's do it!
-Come on!
-对,我们快找! -快!

00:02:04.452 --> 00:02:05.619
Yeah!

00:02:06.704 --> 00:02:09.915
We should have
honeymooned at your parents!
我们应该去你父母家渡蜜月

00:02:21.927 --> 00:02:23.429
Okay, okay, where am I going?
我该去哪里?

00:02:23.471 --> 00:02:26.599
The human world,
before Johnny's gone forever.
人类世界,趁约翰尼永远消失前

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:27.766
But what about the sun?
太阳呢?

00:02:28.434 --> 00:02:31.896
I don't know. I'll just have to roll.
我不知道.我必须适应

00:02:31.937 --> 00:02:33.814
He just rolls. Rollability.
他要适应.有适应能力

00:02:34.773 --> 00:02:36.150
So we follow his boot-prints.
我们跟踪他的鞋印

00:02:36.275 --> 00:02:38.652
When they run out,
that's where you come in, Wayne.
找不到鞋印时,轮到你出马,韦恩

00:02:38.777 --> 00:02:39.945
-Me?
-There!
-我? -那里!

00:02:42.573 --> 00:02:45.993
Yes, I knew something would
fall out of that backpack.
我就知道会有东西从他背包掉出来

00:02:47.286 --> 00:02:49.622
That stinks!
真臭!

00:02:49.747 --> 00:02:50.956
Work your magic.
使用你的法力

00:02:51.081 --> 00:02:53.125
Wait, you want me to track the smell?
等等,你要我追踪他的气味?

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.586
No. My sniffing tracking
days are way behind me.
不.我的嗅觉追踪能力没有了

00:02:55.669 --> 00:02:57.588
Do you know how many
diapers I've changed?
你知道我换了多少片尿片吗?

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.257
How many number twos
have destroyed this thing?
多少粪便毁了这东西吗?

00:03:00.299 --> 00:03:01.842
But...
但是..

00:03:15.272 --> 00:03:17.483
Hey! Take it easy! Watch it!
嘿!冷静.看!

00:03:18.484 --> 00:03:19.985
Sit.
坐

00:03:20.861 --> 00:03:23.155
Smell. I said smell.
我说嗅

00:03:25.491 --> 00:03:28.202
Not me, the shirt! The shirt!
不是我,衣服

00:03:28.327 --> 00:03:31.038
Do any of your kids still respect you?
你哪一个孩子还尊敬你?

00:03:31.163 --> 00:03:37.002
Give me a second. Yeah. Winnie!
Front and center!
温妮!马上过来

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:49.515
He got into a car. A '86 Fiat.
他上了一辆车.86年的菲亚特

00:03:49.557 --> 00:03:53.852
It needs a little transmission work,
but otherwise okay.
变速器需要维修,其他还好

00:03:53.894 --> 00:03:59.024
It drove through town to the airport.
Flight 497.
驶过城市去机场

00:03:59.066 --> 00:04:00.526
8:00 a.m. departure.
早上8点起飞

00:04:00.651 --> 00:04:02.486
That's in 15 minutes.
15分钟后

00:04:02.528 --> 00:04:04.196
Seat 23A.
23A座位

00:04:04.822 --> 00:04:06.407
He ordered the vegetarian meal.
他点了一个素餐

00:04:06.532 --> 00:04:08.867
Okay, thank you, cutie.
好,谢谢你,小可爱

00:04:09.034 --> 00:04:11.036
Now, all of you, go back to your mother!
你们现在回去妈妈那里

00:04:19.545 --> 00:04:20.671
Sheep!
绵羊

00:04:30.264 --> 00:04:33.058
High five! Don't leave me hanging.
击掌!不要让我空等

00:04:34.268 --> 00:04:36.270
-Lots of sheep!
-I got this one.
-很多绵羊! -我来处理

00:04:43.402 --> 00:04:46.530
What? Now there's no sheep in the road.
Let's go.
什么?现在没有绵羊在路上.走吧

00:04:46.572 --> 00:04:48.198
That was pretty sick, man.
真恶心

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:50.618
You eat lamb chops, it's the same thing.
你吃羊排,同样的东西

00:04:50.743 --> 00:04:52.578
We don't have time for this.
Come on, let's move it!
我们没时间吵.快走吧!

00:04:56.915 --> 00:04:58.792
Look, a human.
看,人类

00:05:00.461 --> 00:05:05.257
Welcome to Transylvania!
欢迎光临特兰西瓦尼亚!

00:05:07.801 --> 00:05:10.387
That was trippy.
不寻常的热情

00:05:10.471 --> 00:05:11.889
Monster Festival?
-欢迎光临怪物庆典
-怪物庆典?

00:05:12.431 --> 00:05:13.891
What's a Monster Festival?
什么是怪物庆典?

00:05:20.648 --> 00:05:22.650
Did they know we were coming?
他们知道我们来?

